        "Core chassis + banking overlay",
        "This assessment was measured at the Quick tier — a deliberate subset of the instrument. Scores are directional at this depth; a defended",
        "maturity claim needs the Deep Dive tier's full question set.",
        "What the overall score is, and is not",
        "The overall figure of 1.2 is the weight-adjusted mean of the 11 answered questions, drawn from 11 scored pillars. That",
        "denominator — 11, not 11 — is the number of pillars with at least one answer under this layer. Pillars carrying no answer",
        "contribute nothing to the numerator and nothing to the denominator; they are not counted as zero.",
        "Questions carry a weight of 1 (contextual), 2 (important) or 3 (decisive). A decisive question moves a pillar's score three times as",
